      "instance_name": "man_pointing_at_woman",
      "label": "man pointing at woman",
      "description": "An older man wearing glasses and a dark sweater, holding a cigarette in his mouth and pointing his finger forward, is directing his attention toward a woman standing beside him. The woman, dressed in traditional attire, is looking toward the man with a slight smile. The scene is framed against a brick wall background, and overlaid text reads 'you see that?? it means get the fuck back to the kitchen,' which contextualizes the man's gesture as enforcing a misogynistic stereotype.",
