      "label": "Misogynous Stereotype: 'Women Belong in the Kitchen'",
      "description": "This is a historically entrenched and harmful stereotype that confines women to domestic roles, implying they are not suited for professional or public life. The meme uses this stereotype to mock or reinforce gender-based discrimination, which is a core component of misogynistic discourse. The text 'it means get the fuck back to the kitchen' explicitly invokes this trope.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
